contentText:
Tom Morello &#8216;s idea of &#8220;Date Night&#8221; isn&#8217;t exactly dinner and a movie. The rocker just dropped a new song on Tuesday (July 28) paying homage to three young women who lured Nazis to their deaths during World War II, one of several anti-fascist songs on his newly announced album, Everyone Gets Everything They Want .

